# Build-context guard for docker/Dockerfile (the single image). Patterns are
# relative to the repo-root context, and nested paths need `**/` (a bare name
# matches the context root only). Keeps the 2.5 GB cargo target/,
# node_modules, local state and every dotenv file (so no secret enters the
# build context) out of the tar stream. The runner's and the
# UI's sources must stay IN the context: both are built inside the image.

**/target
**/dist
**/out
**/node_modules
**/.wrangler
**/.celld
data
**/*.sqlite
**/*.sqlite-shm
**/*.sqlite-wal
**/.git
**/.gitignore
**/*.dockerignore
**/.idea
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/.dev.vars
**/.dev.vars.*
**/*.md
**/*.mdx
backups
